#: nodes/sample_nodes/edit_node.py:30
msgid "Accumulates a sound by summing over positive input differences thus generating a monotonic sigal. If additivity is set to true negative input differences get added too, but positive ones with a factor of two. Note that with additivity the signal is not monotonic anymore."
msgstr "通过对正的输入差值求和来累加声音，从而生成单调信号。若开启可加性，负的输入差值也会被加入，但正的输入差值会乘以二。注意启用可加性后信号不再是单调的。"

